# Compile assets after JavaScript changes

When this task creates or edits a file under `assets/` or `importmap.php`, compile assets before the task is finished.

Run this command yourself from the project root. Do not ask the user to run it.

```bash
docker compose exec php composer assets:compile
```

- Run it in the same turn as the JavaScript change, after the file edits.
- If it fails, fix the cause and run it again.
- Do not end the task while this command is still pending or failing.
- Do not run it for Twig, PHP, or CSS-only changes.
